'''R0-H2'''<ref name="Flight Log">''[[Poe Dameron: Flight Log]]''</ref> was an [[R0-series astromech droid|R0]]<ref name="By the numbers" /> [[astromech droid]] that served in the [[Resistance]] during its [[Cold War|conflict]] with the [[First Order]]. During the [[Battle of Takodana]], R0-H2 served as [[Commander]] [[Poe Dameron]]'s astromech.<ref name="Episode VII" />

